Task 3: Wait for all pods to be ready again  
Description Task 3: Continuously check if all pods across all namespaces are in a ready state using kubectl. The task will retry up to 100 times with a 15-second delay between attempts. It is delegated to the active server or the first server in the rke2_servers_group_name group. The task runs once and only if ansible_check_mode is false and rke2_wait_for_all_pods_to_be_ready is true.


