Description Task 2: Install bash package.

Task 3: Install OpenJDK Java
Description Task 3: Install OpenJDK Java package when java_vendor is set to "openjdk".

Task 4: Install Oracle Java RPM from local
Description Task 4: Copy and install Oracle Java RPM package when java_source is "local" and java_format is "rpm".

Task 5: Install Oracle Java DEB from local
Description Task 5: Copy and install Oracle Java DEB package when java_source is "local" and java_format is "deb".

Task 6: Install Oracle Java RPM from repository
Description Task 6: Install Oracle Java RPM package when java_source is "repository" and java_format is "rpm".

Task 7: Configure Oracle Java targz installation
Description Task 7: Extract and install Oracle Java targz package when java_format is "targz" and java_vendor is "oracle".

Task 8: Install Oracle Java JCE policy
